  unitName: Lawson Metal God
  unitId: 50534
  unitNumber: 679
  description: The all-purpose store "Lawson" appeared suddenly through a loophole
    in the gate that leads to another world. It is said that once some Summoners
    tried to visit the store and there was a Metal God dressed in a blue and white
    striped uniform working inside. Stating that it wanted to try new experiences
    in order to grow, the Metal God receives his customers with a smile from ear
    to ear. Unfortunately, even though it has tried new things, its knowledge and
    skills don't seem to have improved.
  summonDesc: Welcome<br>to Grand Gaia's Lawson!<br>What's that?<br>No, you can't
    heat me up!
